# Judge calibration working directory. Most of it is generated by
# eval/score/build-calibration-pack.js and can be rebuilt, so it stays out. The
# exceptions below cannot be regenerated: the marker sheets carry human ratings,
# the judge ratings came from a non-deterministic model, and agreement.json is
# what the report's calibration figures are computed from. Note the `/*`: git
# will not apply a negation inside a directory that is excluded as a whole.
plugins/webex/calibration/*
!plugins/webex/calibration/agreement.json
!plugins/webex/calibration/judge-ratings.json
!plugins/webex/calibration/MANIFEST.md
!plugins/webex/calibration/README.md
!plugins/webex/calibration/*-marker-*.md

# Report working directory: reference reports, drafts, figures. Writing, not source.
report/
